{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205420","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205420","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1520542001:1":{"text":"あぁ……お母ちゃん……","source_cn":"……阿娘……啊啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B73B96987A2D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520542002:0":{"text":"パーム！ああ、あたしの可愛い娘……お母ちゃんだよ！もう大丈夫だから……全部、終わったんだよ！","source_cn":"孩子，我的孩子……！阿娘在呢，就在这……已经没事了，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A3349494997A3E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520542003:1":{"text":"あんたは勇敢に最後まで戦ったんだ。だからもうすぐ、神々の元へ帰れるんだよ……","source_cn":"你是最勇敢的战士，你战斗到了最后一刻，你马上就能回归众...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F8F997CF6FE3F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520542004:1":{"text":"そう……ヤクボルの月は……もう赤くならない……","source_cn":"是吗，雅库伯尔之月……不再鲜红了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E1A543EA8CCBAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520542005:1":{"text":"でも、月は変わらず、ヤクボルを照らす、でしょ？淡い、銀色の光が……川の流れのように……","source_cn":"但是，月亮还会照耀雅库伯尔，对吗？淡淡的，银色的月光…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDCED49190BE4EED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t